"note": "Hi @guidocasati @messaouf we are able to reproduce it reliable in a much more simple way:\n- Start CN\n- Start gNB in RFsim\n- Start UE in RFsim\n- Start DL traffic, the logs will appear immediately:\n```\n[SDAP]\u00a0\u00a0 Dropping UL SDAP PDU with unmapped QFI=5 (ue=0 pdu_session=1 drb=1)\n[SDAP]\u00a0\u00a0 Dropping UL SDAP PDU with unmapped QFI=5 (ue=0 pdu_session=1 drb=1)\n```",
"note_html": "<p data-sourcepos=\"1:1-1:89\" dir=\"auto\">Hi <a href=\"/guidocasati\" title=\"Guido Casati\" class=\"gfm gfm-project_member js-user-link\" data-user=\"7335\" data-original=\"@guidocasati\" data-container=\"body\" data-placement=\"top\" data-reference-type=\"user\">@guidocasati</a> <a href=\"/messaouf\" title=\"Franck MESSAOUDI\" class=\"gfm gfm-project_member js-user-link\" data-user=\"10562\" data-original=\"@messaouf\" data-container=\"body\" data-placement=\"top\" data-reference-type=\"user\">@messaouf</a> we are able to reproduce it reliable in a much more simple way:</p>\n<ul data-sourcepos=\"2:1-5:3\" dir=\"auto\">\n<li data-sourcepos=\"2:1-2:10\">Start CN</li>\n<li data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:20\">Start gNB in RFsim</li>\n<li data-sourcepos=\"4:1-4:19\">Start UE in RFsim</li>\n<li data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:53\">Start DL traffic, the logs will appear immediately:</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"gl-relative markdown-code-block js-markdown-code\"><pre data-sourcepos=\"6:1-9:3\" class=\"code highlight js-syntax-highlight language-plaintext\" v-pre=\"true\"><code><span id=\"LC1\" class=\"line\" lang=\"plaintext\">[SDAP]   Dropping UL SDAP PDU with unmapped QFI=5 (ue=0 pdu_session=1 drb=1)</span>\n<span id=\"LC2\" class=\"line\" lang=\"plaintext\">[SDAP]   Dropping UL SDAP PDU with unmapped QFI=5 (ue=0 pdu_session=1 drb=1)</span></code></pre><copy-code></copy-code><insert-code-snippet></insert-code-snippet></div>",
"body_first_line_html": "<p>Hi <a href=\"/guidocasati\" title=\"Guido Casati\" class=\"gfm gfm-project_member js-user-link\" data-user=\"7335\" data-reference-type=\"user\">@guidocasati</a> <a href=\"/messaouf\" title=\"Franck MESSAOUDI\" class=\"gfm gfm-project_member js-user-link\" data-user=\"10562\" data-reference-type=\"user\">@messaouf</a> we are able to reproduce it reliable in a much more simple way:...</p>",
