"note": "I realised there are 2 issues that can have the same symptom. One is this one, the CN to gNB N3 path: the simple-switch UPF sends DL GTP-U with default qfi = 0x05 until an UL packet reclassifies the session.\n\nIn [https://github.com/duranta-project/openairinterface5g/pull/158](https://github.com/duranta-project/openairinterface5g/pull/158#issuecomment-4667562686) I noticed that it can also happen the following: gNB sends DL without SDAP header, the UE SDAP sees raw IPv4 SDUs and QFI=5 comes from IPv4 header byte 0x45, not from the UPF.",
